{% comment %}
Transition Dossier Integration Section
Related dossiers for a transition (intervention logic)
{% endcomment %}

<section class="transition-dossiers">
  <div class="transition-dossiers__container">
    
    <div class="transition-dossiers__header">
      <h2 class="transition-dossiers__title">Intervention Logic</h2>
      <p class="transition-dossiers__subtitle">
        From observation to action. Dossiers translate research into tools, approaches, and frameworks you can implement.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="transition-dossiers__grid">
      
      <div class="transition-dossier-card">
        
        <div class="transition-dossier-card__header">
          <h3 class="transition-dossier-card__title">
            <a href="/pages/the-cold-exposure-protocol">The Cold Exposure Protocol</a>
          </h3>
        </div>

        <p class="transition-dossier-card__description">
          A structured cold-water exposure sequence designed to rapidly elevate core body temperature and activate your nervous system for wakefulness. Evidence-based timing, duration, and implementation guidance.
        </p>

        <ul class="transition-dossier-card__features">
          <li>Step-by-step protocol (duration: 5-15 min)</li>
          <li>Adaptation timeline and progression</li>
          <li>Nervous system activation metrics</li>
          <li>Safety contraindications and modifications</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="transition-dossier-card__cta">
          <a href="/pages/the-cold-exposure-protocol" class="transition-dossier-card__link">
            Explore Protocol →
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="transition-dossier-card">
        
        <div class="transition-dossier-card__header">
          <h3 class="transition-dossier-card__title">
            <a href="/pages/the-light-timing-framework">The Light Timing Framework</a>
          </h3>
        </div>

        <p class="transition-dossier-card__description">
          Leverage circadian biology by timing light exposure correctly. This framework maps your personal chronotype to optimal light timing, intensity, and duration for faster wakefulness onset.
        </p>

        <ul class="transition-dossier-card__features">
          <li>Chronotype assessment checklist</li>
          <li>Light intensity recommendations (lux)</li>
          <li>Window timing for different seasons</li>
          <li>Device and location guidance</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="transition-dossier-card__cta">
          <a href="/pages/the-light-timing-framework" class="transition-dossier-card__link">
            Explore Framework →
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="transition-dossier-card">
        
        <div class="transition-dossier-card__header">
          <h3 class="transition-dossier-card__title">
            <a href="/pages/the-anchor-sequence">The Anchor Sequence</a>
          </h3>
        </div>

        <p class="transition-dossier-card__description">
          Build an automatic transition into wakefulness using micro-habits. This dossier provides templates for designing a personal anchor sequence that trains your nervous system to respond predictably.
        </p>

        <ul class="transition-dossier-card__features">
          <li>Anchor selection criteria (sensory vs. behavioral)</li>
          <li>Sequence design template</li>
          <li>Implementation timeline (14-30 days)</li>
          <li>Progress tracking and troubleshooting</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="transition-dossier-card__cta">
          <a href="/pages/the-anchor-sequence" class="transition-dossier-card__link">
            Explore Sequence →
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .transition-dossiers {
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    background: #fff;
  }

  .transition-dossiers__container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .transition-dossiers__header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .transition-dossiers__title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #1a1a18;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
  }

  .transition-dossiers__subtitle {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #666;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .transition-dossiers__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .transition-dossier-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: #faf7f2;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .transition-dossier-card:hover {
    background: #f5f2ed;
  }

  .transition-dossier-card__header {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .transition-dossier-card__title {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .transition-dossier-card__title a {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1a1a18;
    text-decoration: none;
    line-height: 1.4;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .transition-dossier-card__title a:hover {
    color: #666;
  }

  .transition-dossier-card__description {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #666;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .transition-dossier-card__features {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .transition-dossier-card__features li {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #666;
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .transition-dossier-card__features li::before {
    content: '◆';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #999;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .transition-dossier-card__cta {
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .transition-dossier-card__link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #1a1a18;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .transition-dossier-card__link:hover {
    color: #666;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .transition-dossiers {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .transition-dossiers__title {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .transition-dossiers__subtitle {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .transition-dossiers__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .transition-dossier-card {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>

